<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine companies six months results forecasts.</title>
<headline>Philippine companies six months results forecasts.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following forecasts are based on polls of Manila-based stock brokerages of their expectations for first half results of the Philippines' leading listed companies. The actual figures are due in the latter half of July.</p>
<p>This table will be published daily, updated with each new</p>
<p>company poll.</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>ABS-CBN INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso million)</p>
<p>Average forecast    824		 1,803</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    676		 1,530</p>
<p>Percentage change + 21.9	    + 17.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>METROPOLITAN BANK &amp; TRUST CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.68		6.63</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    2.034	     5.002</p>
<p>Percentage change + 31.76	   + 32.54</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>AYALA CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    3.59		7.03</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    3.45		6.23</p>
<p>Percentage change + 4.06	    + 12.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>SAN MIGUEL CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    2.40		6.01</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    2.41		5.26</p>
<p>Percentage change - 0.41	    + 14.26</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>PHILIPPINE LONG DISTANCE TELEPHONE CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion)</p>
<p>Average forecast    3.18		6.41</p>
<p>Year-ago figures    2.91		6.44</p>
<p>Percentage change + 9.28	    - 0.47</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
